<h1>Migration guide (v2 → v3) <span class='chip chip--success'>Recommended</span></h1>
<p>v3 ships with event retention configuration — a simple but powerful feature for compliance-driven pipelines. The migration is minimal: the endpoint remains backward-compatible, so you can upgrade at your own pace.</p>

<h2 id="overview">What's new in v3</h2>
<p>v3 adds a single new optional parameter to pipeline creation and updates:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong><code>retention_days</code></strong> — Control how long events are kept in each pipeline (1–365 days, default: 30). Allows fine-grained control over data lifecycle and compliance obligations without blanket org-wide policies.</li>
